{"4231220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Augment Protocol", "steam_appid": 4231220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The year is 1993</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Megan Marsh, a covert operative contracted by NeuraCorp—the world's leading biotechnology corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially, they create the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unofficially, they create monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignment is simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter sealed facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate failed experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erase the evidence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No witnesses. No survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.poster.avif?t=1783858073\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.webm?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.mp4?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NeuraCorp's Mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For decades, NeuraCorp has pushed human augmentation beyond ethical limits. Most experiments were considered successes. Some were not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The failures didn't die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They adapted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now entire facilities have fallen silent, overrun by the very creations NeuraCorp tried to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/f7e4a4dd433df6066b2cc6d9529d6ebb.poster.avif?t=1783858073\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/f7e4a4dd433df6066b2cc6d9529d6ebb.webm?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight For Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment Protocol is a third-person action-horror survival shooter focused on crowd control, positioning, and momentum.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight relentless hordes of augmented enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Bio-Credits by surviving longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new sectors of quarantined research facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open chokepoints, alternate routes, and escape paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal and tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger devastating chain reactions by exploiting enemy augmentations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down massive experimental bosses while surviving waves of supporting enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Retro-Future Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grounded 1990s retro-future inspired by industrial science fiction and corporate cyberpunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT monitors flicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel corridors hum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate secrets rot behind sealed blast doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every facility tells the same story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something went wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/e44e71d2997670a71adf359f1f6ab7d6.avif?t=1783858073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras_big/e44e71d2997670a71adf359f1f6ab7d6.webp?t=1783858073 width=1560 height=936 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cleanup Is Never Clean</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren't sent to save humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent to protect NeuraCorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difference may cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The year is 1993</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Megan Marsh, a covert operative contracted by NeuraCorp—the world's leading biotechnology corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially, they create the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unofficially, they create monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignment is simple:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter sealed facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate failed experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erase the evidence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No witnesses. No survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.poster.avif?t=1783858073\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.webm?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/1d149224d3440a162cf1fce001f116d2.mp4?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">NeuraCorp's Mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For decades, NeuraCorp has pushed human augmentation beyond ethical limits. Most experiments were considered successes. Some were not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The failures didn't die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They adapted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now entire facilities have fallen silent, overrun by the very creations NeuraCorp tried to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/f7e4a4dd433df6066b2cc6d9529d6ebb.poster.avif?t=1783858073\" width=616 height=393 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/f7e4a4dd433df6066b2cc6d9529d6ebb.webm?t=1783858073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight For Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment Protocol is a third-person action-horror survival shooter focused on crowd control, positioning, and momentum.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight relentless hordes of augmented enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Bio-Credits by surviving longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new sectors of quarantined research facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open chokepoints, alternate routes, and escape paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your arsenal and tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger devastating chain reactions by exploiting enemy augmentations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down massive experimental bosses while surviving waves of supporting enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Retro-Future Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grounded 1990s retro-future inspired by industrial science fiction and corporate cyberpunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT monitors flicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel corridors hum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate secrets rot behind sealed blast doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every facility tells the same story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something went wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras/e44e71d2997670a71adf359f1f6ab7d6.avif?t=1783858073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/extras_big/e44e71d2997670a71adf359f1f6ab7d6.webp?t=1783858073 width=1560 height=936 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cleanup Is Never Clean</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You weren't sent to save humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent to protect NeuraCorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difference may cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Enter a retro-futuristic nightmare of failed human augmentation. Fight relentless hordes, earn Bio-Credits, unlock quarantined facility sectors, and eradicate the grotesque experiments NeuraCorp left behind.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/da00cda335cff3f0cdd3522fa49b28338bbfa1ec/header.jpg?t=1783858073", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4231220/beb605cdca9dfc9ff261bb5ec9fef2ea185c129b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783858073", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st